 "solution": "\\(\\frac{b}{a}=\\frac{2b}{2a}\\)。\n\\(\\frac{2b}{2a}-\\frac{a+2b}{2a}=\\frac{2b-a-2b}{2a}=\\frac{-a}{2a}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\)。",
 "explanation": {
